    "code": "class Solution:\r\n    def getRow(self, rowIndex: int) -> List[int]:\r\n        f = [1] * (rowIndex + 1)\r\n        for i in range(2, rowIndex + 1):\r\n            for j in range(i - 1, 0, -1):\r\n                f[j] += f[j - 1]\r\n        return f",
